{"2026.5.8:P01-Q09":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>最高价水化物酸碱性推断元素</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.5.8 · 长沙市一中四月阶段检测 · 原题9 · P01-Q09</div><h1>最高价水化物酸碱性推断元素</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：物质结构与性质/元素周期表 元素周期律/元素周期律</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：依据pH半径及原子序数识别元素并比较结构与性质。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/溶液的酸碱性与pH</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/分子的构型及相关理论</span><span class=\"tag\">常见无机物及其应用/金属资源的开发与金属材料/其他金属及其化合物</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/原子结构与性质/电离能 电负性</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>9. 常温下，W、X、Y、Z四种短周期元素的最高价氧化物对应的水化物溶液(浓度均为<img src=\"chem-asset:fd7921a0ff0e23c1852e194c714bf66fc2a3b6433ad67436f0463362071f0fea:0;\" style=\"width:87.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)的<img src=\"chem-asset:5b96d57a42452037809d5fbe4f4fb317f25c4b4ce6f65da1dcb79304629c46f4:1;\" style=\"width:25.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和原子半径、原子序数的关系如图所示。下列说法错误的是</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:86ea25d03a72d4f8bca8028fee135a49e4095f1eea0d8193c8b36dbe7cb18609:2;\" style=\"width:215.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>A. <img src=\"chem-asset:f5784cec7753e5b3c1e0267640bd3a7ae8083d8c51ba3bb5d09ed4364e436831:3;\" style=\"width:35.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的空间结构是三角锥形</p><p>B. 工业上采用电解法冶炼<img src=\"chem-asset:47fbce1ef96fc174720b6a99513424320120996f12dc4c17616f7b2e2578d353:4;\" style=\"width:17.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. 简单离子的半径：<img src=\"chem-asset:3f7ffcf4f6a20ecbee18155391a4eff3acef9606f11f2c7677bdc35fea74995d:5;\" style=\"width:48.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. 简单气态氢化物的稳定性：<img src=\"chem-asset:d320bcf44da7f1eb89a4aa7186ba0d6cea2f4d2047ea5c944f455114ccf10971:6;\" style=\"width:44.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【分析】浓度均为<img src=\"chem-asset:dba92791abc048d319cf1c5f5583c7d6bf3ae25b9bcecfcef68d45c7d736877f:7;\" style=\"width:85.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的溶液，W、Y、Z的最高价氧化物对应的水化物的<img src=\"chem-asset:5b96d57a42452037809d5fbe4f4fb317f25c4b4ce6f65da1dcb79304629c46f4:1;\" style=\"width:25.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">都小于7，W、Y、Z的最高价氧化物对应的水化物是酸，说明W、Y、Z是非金属元素，W、Z的最高价氧化物对应的水化物的pH=2，即为一元强酸，原子序数：<img src=\"chem-asset:54b2896731c7ad4434c257c6c57d67e06e899653b85fe8bc7f051e0f039dc637:8;\" style=\"width:47.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则Z是<img src=\"chem-asset:7fbba99f851160e9836f4b2fb102a7ce0b8d2caa4f3148c929dc716046bca74f:9;\" style=\"width:20.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、W是N；Y的最高价氧化物对应的水化物的<img src=\"chem-asset:5660b0cab21bb28a92cda13c3bb2dc485db5f20d2e0a180b7140bd905af24407:10;\" style=\"width:49.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，即为二元强酸硫酸，则Y是S；X的最高价氧化物对应的水化物的<img src=\"chem-asset:a2feadc3b81aab1b481a860b0f073f98067be3e577708f5f08876dbf24a0f6eb:11;\" style=\"width:56.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，即为一元强碱氢氧化钠，则X是<img src=\"chem-asset:09b8efc288cb9f2d3890a1f32e2e0c70066e4579c34e47acb9b69b256f5585cb:12;\" style=\"width:25.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，由以上分析可知，W、X、Y、Z分别为N、<img src=\"chem-asset:09b8efc288cb9f2d3890a1f32e2e0c70066e4579c34e47acb9b69b256f5585cb:12;\" style=\"width:25.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、S、<img src=\"chem-asset:7fbba99f851160e9836f4b2fb102a7ce0b8d2caa4f3148c929dc716046bca74f:9;\" style=\"width:20.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">。</p><p>【详解】A．<img src=\"chem-asset:f5784cec7753e5b3c1e0267640bd3a7ae8083d8c51ba3bb5d09ed4364e436831:3;\" style=\"width:35.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为<img src=\"chem-asset:63003aed8e0ecaf251a20c92b5b4af0e58ede21fca681d3af993769969c58d53:13;\" style=\"width:37.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:63003aed8e0ecaf251a20c92b5b4af0e58ede21fca681d3af993769969c58d53:13;\" style=\"width:37.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中N原子形成3个<img src=\"chem-asset:841de1b1e92d11262ed73ec2d21d7bed47474a965b1a610595f3b5c90d81fa30:14;\" style=\"width:16.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">键，有一对未成键的孤电子对，采取<img src=\"chem-asset:5b92e560e7d320aa21c95877d122277aa369e3842afbe739387d2cbfbe7628be:15;\" style=\"width:23.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">杂化，<img src=\"chem-asset:63003aed8e0ecaf251a20c92b5b4af0e58ede21fca681d3af993769969c58d53:13;\" style=\"width:37.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的空间结构是三角锥形，A正确；</p><p>B．<img src=\"chem-asset:09b8efc288cb9f2d3890a1f32e2e0c70066e4579c34e47acb9b69b256f5585cb:12;\" style=\"width:25.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">是非常活泼的金属，工业上采用电解法冶炼，B正确；</p><p>C．W、X的简单离子分别为<img src=\"chem-asset:73534895c4ddeb5a8b4898d839a89f250f2449d8552f5411976e633690fbadae:16;\" style=\"width:28.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:5fab9865dad1ce542338a3f23e09cc90ef03f4ffb78e6fb506b55fa1ba0e452e:17;\" style=\"width:30.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，电子层结构相同，核电荷数：<img src=\"chem-asset:73534895c4ddeb5a8b4898d839a89f250f2449d8552f5411976e633690fbadae:16;\" style=\"width:28.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">&lt;<img src=\"chem-asset:5fab9865dad1ce542338a3f23e09cc90ef03f4ffb78e6fb506b55fa1ba0e452e:17;\" style=\"width:30.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则离子半径：<img src=\"chem-asset:73534895c4ddeb5a8b4898d839a89f250f2449d8552f5411976e633690fbadae:16;\" style=\"width:28.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">&gt;<img src=\"chem-asset:5fab9865dad1ce542338a3f23e09cc90ef03f4ffb78e6fb506b55fa1ba0e452e:17;\" style=\"width:30.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，即简单离子半径：W&gt;X，C错误；</p><p>D．Y、Z的简单气态氢化物分别是H<sub>2</sub>S、HCl，非金属性越强，简单气态氢化物的稳定性越强，所以稳定性：HCl &gt;H<sub>2</sub>S，即Z＞Y，D正确；</p><p>故选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.5.8\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市第一中学2025-2026学年高三下学期4月阶段检测 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.5.8/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62025-2026%E5%AD%A6%E5%B9%B4%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F4%E6%9C%88%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E6%A3%80%E6%B5%8B%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["09b8efc288cb9f2d3890a1f32e2e0c70066e4579c34e47acb9b69b256f5585cb","3f7ffcf4f6a20ecbee18155391a4eff3acef9606f11f2c7677bdc35fea74995d","47fbce1ef96fc174720b6a99513424320120996f12dc4c17616f7b2e2578d353","54b2896731c7ad4434c257c6c57d67e06e899653b85fe8bc7f051e0f039dc637","5660b0cab21bb28a92cda13c3bb2dc485db5f20d2e0a180b7140bd905af24407","5b92e560e7d320aa21c95877d122277aa369e3842afbe739387d2cbfbe7628be","5b96d57a42452037809d5fbe4f4fb317f25c4b4ce6f65da1dcb79304629c46f4","5fab9865dad1ce542338a3f23e09cc90ef03f4ffb78e6fb506b55fa1ba0e452e","63003aed8e0ecaf251a20c92b5b4af0e58ede21fca681d3af993769969c58d53","73534895c4ddeb5a8b4898d839a89f250f2449d8552f5411976e633690fbadae","7fbba99f851160e9836f4b2fb102a7ce0b8d2caa4f3148c929dc716046bca74f","841de1b1e92d11262ed73ec2d21d7bed47474a965b1a610595f3b5c90d81fa30","86ea25d03a72d4f8bca8028fee135a49e4095f1ee